# Google Calendar API OAuth Credentials
# Obtain these from the Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create or select a project.
# 3. Enable the "Google Calendar API" under APIs & Services.
# 4. Configure the OAuth consent screen (scopes: .../auth/calendar.events).
# 5. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID credentials (Application type: Desktop app).
# 6. Copy and paste your Client ID and Client Secret below:

GCAL_CLIENT_ID="your_google_client_id_here.apps.googleusercontent.com"
GCAL_CLIENT_SECRET="your_google_client_secret_here"
